{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and motion capabilities, separating sensor outcomes from motion commands. The specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk is preferred in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and conservative recovery (turns or full_rotate) is used only when obstacles are detected. Recovery states are one-shot and return to exploration as soon as the path is clear. All uncontrollable events are handled deterministically and safely.",
