    "Separate plant automata for perception and motion: G1 for perception (obstacle events), G2 for motion (motion commands).",
    "Specification E1 encodes the exploration policy: random_walk in clear, move_forward for short progress, rotate_clockwise or rotate_counterclockwise for obstacle recovery, and full_rotate only as a last resort."
